      "heading": "题目描述",
      "html": "<div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"markdown\"><p>给定一个长度为 <span class=\"katex math inline\">n</span> 的数组，输出数组中有多少对 <span class=\"katex math inline\">a[i], a[j]</span>（<span class=\"katex math inline\">i &lt; j</span>）满足它们的和是素数。</p>\n</div>            </div>",
      "text": "给定一个长度为 n 的数组，输出数组中有多少对 a[i], a[j]（i < j）满足它们的和是素数。"
    },
    {
      "heading": "输入",
      "html": "<div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"markdown\"><p>第一行一个整数 <span class=\"katex math inline\">n</span>。（<span class=\"katex math inline\">1 ≤ n ≤ 100</span>）</p>\n<p>第二行 <span class=\"katex math inline\">n</span> 个整数 <span class=\"katex math inline\">a[i]</span>。（<span class=\"katex math inline\">1 ≤ a[i] ≤ 100</span>）</p>\n</div>            </div>",
      "text": "第一行一个整数 n。（1 ≤ n ≤ 100）\n第二行 n 个整数 a[i]。（1 ≤ a[i] ≤ 100）"
    },
    {
      "heading": "输出",
      "html": "<div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"markdown\"><p>输出一个整数，表示满足条件的数对数量。</p>\n</div>            </div>",
      "text": "输出一个整数，表示满足条件的数对数量。"
    },
    {
      "heading": "样例",
      "html": "<div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"sample-test\">\n                        <div class=\"input\">\n                            <h4>输入</h4>\n                            <pre>4\r\n1 2 3 4</pre>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"output\">\n                            <h4>输出</h4>\n                            <pre>4</pre>\n                        </div>\n\n                        \n                                            </div>\n                </div>",
      "text": "输入\n                            4\r\n1 2 3 4\n                        \n                        \n                            输出\n                            4"
    },
    {
      "heading": "说明",
      "html": "<div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"markdown\"><h4>样例 <span class=\"katex math inline\">1</span> 解释</h4>\n<p>满足条件的数对为 <span class=\"katex math inline\">(1,2)</span> <span class=\"katex math inline\">(1,4)</span> <span class=\"katex math inline\">(2,3)</span> <span class=\"katex math inline\">(3,4)</span>。</p>\n</div>\n\n                    \n                </div>",
